// Title: HackTool - SharpLDAPmonitor Execution
// ID: 9f8fc146-1d1a-4dbf-b8fd-dfae15e08541
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-12-30
// Tags: attack.discovery
// Description: Detects execution of the SharpLDAPmonitor. Which can monitor the creation, deletion and changes to LDAP objects.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/user:") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/pass:") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "/dcip:"))) OR ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\SharpLDAPmonitor.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "SharpLDAPmonitor.exe"))))
